lease: harness/ledger-per-repo
bind: magus session lease harness/ledger-per-repo

goal and acceptance criteria
Move the lease ledger to the per-repository state dir.
Done when a row put from one checkout is listed from a second worktree of the same repo.

owned paths
  internal/ledger
  cmd/magus/ledger.go

forbidden paths
  MAGUS.md
  docs/gen

graph evidence
  internal/ledger -> dir:internal/ledger, blast radius 4

validation, the only check you run
magus run test internal/ledger

depends on
  harness/session-load

bootstrap
  work in your own worktree and confirm it is clean before you edit
    git status --short
  bind the lease so every lease-scoped rule grades your writes here
    magus session lease harness/ledger-per-repo
  record the base you landed on, and register what it prints on lease harness/ledger-per-repo with the magus_ledger tool (op register); writes are denied until the lease has one
    magus vcs checkpoint -o name
